    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847510/extras/66dfe4817dbc1f3973a2f5fde143a452.avif?t=1741030573\" width=580 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a neon-lit cyberpunk world as the manager of a club where lonely clients seek to fulfill their desires. Build android girls from scrap, match them to clients\u2019 needs, and ensure every guest leaves satisfied. Earn money, research new technologies, and dive into your clients\u2019 personal stories\u2014help them solve their problems or make things worse. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847510/extras/1ae4351e47a94d49ab80f6bc4fc05baf.avif?t=1741030573\" width=580 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847510/extras/8194efe3970ceced2ea95dd14cba9443.avif?t=1741030573\" width=580 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage every detail of your club: keep track of finances, restock supplies, assign tasks to your android workers, analyze clients\u2019 needs and desires, and stay informed by monitoring news that shapes the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847510/extras/dee48dfd8955722bf6ad2e191e6f1f69.avif?t=1741030573\" width=580 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847510/extras/febf08c3c16a614e2352b061a5c78668.avif?t=1741030573\" width=580 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble android girls from scrap, design unique models, and customize their abilities to suit your club\u2019s demands. Level them up, install upgrades, and recycle older androids to create even better ones using their parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847510/extras/27793e121276daec356403d36464e532.avif?t=1741030573\" width=580 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with your clients, uncover their problems, and decide their fate. Will you help them overcome their struggles or push them to the edge and watch them fall?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847510/extras/66dfe4817dbc1f3973a2f5fde143a452.avif?t=1741030573\" width=580 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a neon-lit cyberpunk world as the manager of a club where lonely clients seek to fulfill their desires. Build android girls from scrap, match them to clients\u2019 needs, and ensure every guest leaves satisfied. Earn money, research new technologies, and dive into your clients\u2019 personal stories\u2014help them solve their problems or make things worse. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847510/extras/1ae4351e47a94d49ab80f6bc4fc05baf.avif?t=1741030573\" width=580 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847510/extras/8194efe3970ceced2ea95dd14cba9443.avif?t=1741030573\" width=580 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage every detail of your club: keep track of finances, restock supplies, assign tasks to your android workers, analyze clients\u2019 needs and desires, and stay informed by monitoring news that shapes the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847510/extras/dee48dfd8955722bf6ad2e191e6f1f69.avif?t=1741030573\" width=580 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847510/extras/febf08c3c16a614e2352b061a5c78668.avif?t=1741030573\" width=580 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble android girls from scrap, design unique models, and customize their abilities to suit your club\u2019s demands. Level them up, install upgrades, and recycle older androids to create even better ones using their parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847510/extras/27793e121276daec356403d36464e532.avif?t=1741030573\" width=580 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with your clients, uncover their problems, and decide their fate. Will you help them overcome their struggles or push them to the edge and watch them fall?</p>",
