        "notes": "Synthetica: Cyber Club Manager is a management simulation game that involves running a high-end social club in a cyberpunk world. While the game does not contain explicit sexual content, it does include themes of intimacy and relationships as part of its night club simulation. Players manage interactions and cater to the desires of clients seeking companionship from androids, which is suggestive but never visually depicted. The game is designed for a mature audience, with an emphasis on strategy and club management within a futuristic setting."
